# _opencode-local-provider_ OpenCode Plugin
- Ollama
- LM Studio
- oMLX

## Provider Setup
- Ollama: `http://127.0.0.1:11434`
- LM Studio: `http://127.0.0.1:1234`
- llama-swap: `http://127.0.0.1:8080`
- oMLX: `http://127.0.0.1:8000`

## Resulting Config
```
{
  "provider": {
    "local": {
      "name": "Local Provider",
      "options": {
        "includeDefaults": true,
        "targets": {
          "studio": {
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1",
            "kind": "lmstudio"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```
